<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 7.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 4.30 percent.</p>
<p>		   July 1, 2003 CCT     pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   7.98 pct	7.96 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 9.15 pct	9.14 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price	100.55     100.60</p>
<p>    Total bids	  17.383 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	     7.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The comparisons are with a previous auction on August 19 of a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion CCTs.</p>
</text>
